  "id": "oil-spill-transport-world-ocean-circulation-golden-trader",
  "stac_version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "This dataset provides Lagrangian drift data simulated for the Golden Trader (North Sea region) oil spill incident. The oil spill particles' locations (lon, lat) are produced hourly over the time period of the simulation. The product has a spatial resolution of 0.125 deg, a temporal resolution of 1 hour and it is projected in WGS 84 (EPSG:4326)",
